    {
      "id": "notes-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 371,
      "height": 285,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a61",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Storage  SQLite in the DO (5 GB free).\n\nWrites   ~2 samples/min + rare events\n         ~4-8k rows/day   (cap 100k/day)\n\nReads    hot path uses memory ring buffers;\n         SQLite read only on cold start\n         -> far below 5M/day\n\nPrune    UC9 runs hourly:\n         samples > 7 d, events > 30 d,\n         delta_log > 1 h\n\nPlanets  not stored - computed from\n         ephemeris on demand",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1904306185,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Storage  SQLite in the DO (5 GB free).\n\nWrites   ~2 samples/min + rare events\n         ~4-8k rows/day   (cap 100k/day)\n\nReads    hot path uses memory ring buffers;\n         SQLite read only on cold start\n         -> far below 5M/day\n\nPrune    UC9 runs hourly:\n         samples > 7 d, events > 30 d,\n         delta_log > 1 h\n\nPlanets  not stored - computed from\n         ephemeris on demand",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1790934890443,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1545454955,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
